# Everything the build stage rebuilds or never reads. Without this the context
# alone is gigabytes of node_modules and build output, and every `docker build`
# pays for uploading it.
node_modules
**/node_modules
# `docs/` and `website/` stay IN the context: `pnpm run build` typechecks
# `scripts/`, and `scripts/project-doc-site.ts` imports `website/docs.ts`.
# Excluding them saved about a hundred kilobytes and broke the build.
**/lib
**/dist
release
.git
.github
examples
python
*.log
